{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "A charge to a friendly player does not start auto attack on them (#11396)",
  "contract": [
    "Silverhand Incantation 801465 has a CHARGE effect on any target (TARGET_UNIT_TARGET_ANY) and, per its description,",
    "is meant for allies as well as enemies. A friendly player cannot be attacked (IsValidAttackTarget refuses them and",
    "so do harmful spells), so arriving at them must not make them the charger's melee victim. Charging a hostile",
    "creature keeps starting auto attack on it."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
